<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/2 (FIM 261.70).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/2 (FIM 261.70).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-5/8 at $56-1/2 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 261.70 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed up 2.00 markka at 262.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/2 at $34-3/4 on Wall Street on Friday. The price equals about 80.50 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet fell 1.80 markka to close at 79.70 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed up $0-1/8 at $19-1/2 in New York on Friday. The price corresponds to about 90.30 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma added 2.10 to end at 93.60 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
